# services/
#
# Business logic layer — one file per domain feature.
# Each service:
#   - Accepts plain TypeScript arguments (no Express req/res)
#   - Calls repositories for Firestore access
#   - Throws AppError for domain violations
#   - Has no knowledge of HTTP
#
# Stage 2 will add:
#   auth.service.ts       — register, login, assign custom claims
#   event.service.ts      — create, update, start race
#   team.service.ts       — register, approve, track progress
#   checkpoint.service.ts — unlock, complete, skip
#   leaderboard.service.ts — compute rankings, apply penalties
